  {
   "id": "s-t-a-l-k-e-r-call-of-prypiat-enhanced-edition-343444@1.2",
   "gameId": "s-t-a-l-k-e-r-call-of-prypiat-enhanced-edition-343444",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-07-10T16:01:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Stalkers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're excited to share the next major step forward for the Enhanced Edition with the release of Patch 1.2.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update focuses primarily on addressing one of the most common community concerns: image blurriness. Many of you reported a \"soapy\" or blurry visual experience, and we've been working hard to solve this issue. With Patch 1.2, we've implemented significant improvements to sharpen image quality and deliver a much clearer, more defined visual presentation. But that is not all we did for 1.2, we also worked on stability, SSGI and return of free-cam commands. Let's see what is new!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "What is fixed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Stability improvements - fixed multiple crashes on all platforms",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed image blurriness issue",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed foliage texture detail and long-distance LOD's",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a \"mipmap bias\" value setting (ranging from 0 to -2) for the greater texture detail while using FSR feature",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed several shading issues with SSGI (Screen Space Global Illumination)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Implemented quick-save with a limit up to 15 saves (Old quick-saves will remain untouched)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Implemented several fixes for combat A-life behavior",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Returned the demo_record and demo_play commands",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed several audio corruption and audio sync issues across all titles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "\\ Adjusted iron-sights for AKM-74/2 and SA Avalanche weapons",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "\\ Fixed several item descriptions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We greatly appreciate your feedback and support, together we continue sharpening the Enhanced Edition. As always, keep letting us know what’s working and what needs our attention.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you in the Zone, stalkers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
